{# 積木：預訂購物車（七區塊，依 Canva「UI v4 預訂第 1 步」）。價格全部來自 _data/prices.json；算法在 assets/js/pricing.js（和 npm test 共用）；畫面在 assets/js/booking.js #}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/booking.css">
<section class="block booking">
  <div class="wrap booking-grid">
    <form class="card booking-form" id="booking-form" novalidate>
      <h2><span class="num">1</span>選購：潛水、課程、套裝、活動、住宿、交通、裝備</h2>
      <p class="small muted">每一區都可以選，不用的區塊留空就好。人數、間數、天數用 − ＋ 調整，價格自動算。</p>
      <label class="field bk-date"><span>出發日期</span><input type="date" name="date" id="bk-date" required></label>
      <div id="bk-blocks"><p class="small muted">預訂表載入中……如果一直沒出現，請打 <a href="{{ site.company.phoneHref }}">{{ site.company.phone }}</a> 預訂。</p></div>
      <p class="cart-total bk-total">合計　<strong id="cart-total">NT$ 0</strong></p>

      <h2><span class="num">2</span>填資料</h2>
      <div class="fields-2">
        <label class="field"><span>聯絡人姓名</span><input name="name" required placeholder="你的名字" autocomplete="name"></label>
        <label class="field"><span>手機</span><input name="phone" required placeholder="09xx-xxx-xxx" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel"></label>
        <label class="field"><span>Email</span><input name="email" type="email" required placeholder="name@example.com" autocomplete="email"></label>
        <label class="field"><span>出生年月日（保險用）</span><input name="birthday" type="date" required></label>
        <label class="field"><span>緊急聯絡人</span><input name="emergencyName" required placeholder="姓名／關係"></label>
        <label class="field"><span>緊急聯絡人電話</span><input name="emergencyPhone" required placeholder="09xx-xxx-xxx" inputmode="tel"></label>
      </div>
      <label class="field"><span>備註（健康狀況、近視度數、飲食需求）</span><textarea name="note" rows="3" placeholder="例如：近視 400 度、不吃牛肉。"></textarea></label>
      <div id="participants"></div>
      <button type="button" class="link-orange plain" id="add-person">＋ 新增參加者（每位都要填姓名和出生年月日）</button>

      <h2><span class="num">3</span>確認條款</h2>
      <div class="checks">
        <label><input type="checkbox" required> 我已閱讀並同意〈<a href="/terms/" target="_blank">服務條款</a>〉</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" required> 我已閱讀並同意〈<a href="/privacy/" target="_blank">隱私權政策</a>〉</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" required> 我已閱讀並同意〈<a href="/refund/" target="_blank">退款與停航政策</a>〉</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" required> 潛水行程：我會在出發前填寫 PADI 健康問卷</label>
      </div>
      <div class="submit-row">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-orange">前往付款</button>
        <span class="small muted">下一步會跳轉到 PAYUNi 統一金流付款頁</span>
      </div>
      <p class="form-msg" id="form-msg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>

    <aside class="booking-side">
      <div class="card summary" aria-live="polite">
        <h3>訂單摘要</h3>
        <p id="sum-date" class="muted">尚未選日期</p>
        <p id="sum-count" class="muted">還沒選項目</p>
        <hr>
        <ul id="sum-lines" class="sum-lines"></ul>
        <hr>
        <p class="sum-total"><span>合計</span><strong id="sum-total">NT$ 0</strong></p>
        <p class="small"><strong>付款方式</strong><br>信用卡／ATM 轉帳<br><span class="muted">（PAYUNi 統一金流，開通項目待確認）</span></p>
        <p class="small muted">付款完成並收到確認信，訂單才算成立。</p>
      </div>
      <p class="small muted side-note">付款在 PAYUNi 統一金流的加密付款頁完成，綠芙不會看到你的卡號。</p>
      </aside>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap after-pay">
    <h2>付款完成之後</h2>
    <div class="card success">
      <span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
      <div>
        <h3>預訂成功！</h3>
        <p class="small muted">訂單編號　TR20261205-0001（範例）</p>
        <p>確認信會寄到你填的 Email，裡面有訂單明細和付款紀錄。<br>出發前，我們會用電話或 LINE 跟你確認船班和集合時間。<br>沒收到確認信？先看垃圾信件匣，或打 <a href="{{ site.company.phoneHref }}">{{ site.company.phone }}</a> 找我們。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script type="application/json" id="price-data">{{ prices | dump | safe }}</script>
</section>
